  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "While the subtitle is interesting, it would benefit from a complementary adjustment to the main title to ensure alignment and clarity."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet",
      "indent": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "Some minor errors were noted, such as the omission of the domain from the motivation and teaser sections. Additionally, the anchor could be more detailed to provide a stronger foundation."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet",
      "indent": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "At times, the tone veers towards sounding like a sales pitch rather than an academic expose, which detracts from the overall academic rigor."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet",
      "indent": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "It's crucial to explicitly address potential limitations and challenges that could arise during the study, as these are not clearly outlined."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet",
      "indent": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The proposed timeline appears overly ambitious and may need adjustment to ensure realistic milestones."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet",
      "indent": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "Neutral Observations:",
